# Frontend tests (EMIC)

- Co-locate tests: `Component.tsx` → `Component.test.tsx`.
- Shared setup: `frontend/src/test/setup.ts` (jest-dom), fixtures in `frontend/src/test/fixtures.ts`.
- Test `api.ts` with `vi.stubGlobal("fetch")`; include JSON `detail`, empty body, and HTTP status fallbacks.
- Mock `@/lib/api` at component boundaries; use `@testing-library/user-event` for form interactions.
- Mock `next/link`, `next/image`, `next/navigation` in page tests.
